      "message": "I think we shouldn\u0027t use track ID as part of test case combination, this way we are limiting our test cases to only one ID at a time.\nThink about the test case of:\n1. set scale with ID 0;\n2. getParameter and check if ID 0 was successfully set;\n3. set scale with ID 1;\n3. getParameter and check if both ID 0 and 1 are expected.\n\nAnd:\n1. set scale with ID 0, 1, 2;\n2. getParameter and check if all scales successfully set;\n3. set scale with ID 3;\n3. getParameter and check if all IDs (0, 1, 2, 3) are expected.",
